  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It seems like every time I load Avatar whether that be joining joining a new world instance or picking one from my menu while already in a world every other Avatar that I pick loads incorrectly. I can still move around and interact objects but I do not appear in the mirrors and when I look down I can see the avatar it's standing still in the arms don't move the walking animation works it's just it doesn't track correctly. Is really confusing to me is that it's consistently every other Avatar I load. And it seems it's an account bug because no one else I have talked to has experienced this issue.",
